@startuml VibeStump Architecture
!theme cyborg
skinparam DefaultFontName Inter
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam backgroundColor #0B172A
skinparam defaultFontColor #F8FAFC

title **VibeStump — Agentic Premier League Architecture**

actor "Fan\n(Browser)" as fan #00F0FF

package "Google Cloud Run" <<cloud>> #1E293B {

  node "Streamlit Container\n(app.py)" as ui #0B172A {
    [ThemeManager\n(theme.py)] as TM
    [Session State\nMemory] as SS
  }

  package "Agentic Modules" #1E293B {
    [🔭 Scout Agent\n(tools.py)] as Scout
    [🧠 Psychologist\n(agents.py)] as Psych
    [📚 Historian\n(agents.py)] as Hist
    [🎬 Executor\n(tools.py)] as Exec
  }

  package "Fallback Layer" #1E293B {
    [SimulatedLiveFeed\nMatch 57 Data] as Sim
    [Meme Dictionary\nGiphy URLs] as Memes
    [YouTube Fallbacks] as YTF
  }
}

cloud "External APIs" #0F172A {
  [ESPNcricinfo\nRSS Feed] as RSS
  [Google Gemini\n(2.5 Flash)] as Gemini
  [YouTube\nData API v3] as YT
  [Swiggy / Netflix\n(Mock)] as Mock
}

' ── Data Flow ──
fan --> ui : Auto-Refresh\n(8s demo / 30s live)

ui --> Scout : 1. Fetch Data
Scout --> RSS : HTTP GET
Scout ..> Sim : Fallback\n(429/500)

ui --> Psych : 2. Analyze Vibe
Psych --> Gemini : Structured JSON\nSchema
Gemini ..> Psych : {vibe, tension,\nmood, event}

ui --> Hist : 3. Deep Dive\n(on WICKET/SIX)
Hist --> Gemini : Historical Prompt

ui --> Exec : 4. Trigger\nIntervention
Exec --> Memes : Mood → GIF URL

ui --> YT : 5. Match VODs
YT ..> YTF : Fallback

ui --> Mock : Diversion\nProtocol

TM --> ui : CSS Injection\n(Team Colors)
SS --> ui : Vibe History\n(Trend Chart)

@enduml
